                    "text": "Trudeau was claimed off waivers by Nashville on Saturday, per Elliotte Friedman of Sportsnet.\n\nAdvice: After the Rangers waived Trudeau on Friday, the Predators took notice and scooped up the 23-year-old blueliner. He spent the entirety of the 2025-26 campaign with AHL Laval, where he compiled eight goals, 20 points and 54 PIM across 62 regular-season outings. With the Predators claiming the young blueliner, Trudeau could begin the 2026-27 campaign in the NHL.",
